 "text": "Hey, how are you holding up? That's a tough spot. One way to handle it is to give them less than they expect, then with an explanation. Then look up round trip ticket prices and ask how much you' need each month in cash to cover the flight. That's a nice simple amount to give them. Then look up how much watering they' need each week and estimate how much that will cost in water bills. Then look up how much each trip would cost in gas. Then think about how often you'd go if it was one, and how much you' save each time if you shared a ticket.",
